#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:7 45e70cd7032046f18c5f64367a55a6ec
#: 84647f042bc0460aac48b639d509baa8 a79db000369043b1b6fcb3ccfa360510
#: b035b74248f14f78a4834b4b4e2ddef6 b8fc8447ffb242cabff65a6cf0ff71f0
msgid "Buzzer (aka Tone Alarm)"
msgstr "蜂鸣器（又名音调报警）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:12 140508570d5d4553bed83fc5619cb4a2
#: 318e9b7456be46eba55edb161042663e 35ee4afb42a74196adff563019ba434a
#: 61a0e936bfe247bf97a119d63ca92b7e 9a0e079a3359473ea3abcf524306aecd
msgid ""
"A buzzer (or Tone Alarm) can be used to audibly indicate status changes for "
"the vehicle. Depending on board capabilities, this can be an active device "
"(only needs voltage applied to produce a single frequency tone), as shown "
"below, or a passive piezo device driven by PWM capable of producing variable"
" musical tones, as shown above. Some boards can use either type."
msgstr ""
"蜂鸣器（或音调报警）可用于以声音指示飞行器的状态变化。根据板子性能，可以是有源器件（仅需施加电压即可产生单一频率音调，如下图所示），也可以是由PWM驱动、能产生可变音乐音调的无源压电器件（如上图所示）。某些板子两种类型均可使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:17 079b025daa5e47cbbb2d4e2066e8b282
#: 1fc28bf1323f46bc8f7d9d94b1e4b1bc 6cdc7df66ee647a79de616b8642c05c5
#: 833672efa97646d792428f41b7f83976 cfbb9cd5b2da4b41b1bb5f67f5799e51
msgid ""
"If an output capable of producing PWM is used with a passive piezo, it can "
"play various :ref:`sounds <common-sounds-pixhawkpx4>` including the Arming "
"sound, Mode Change sound, and Lost Vehicle Alarms (search for \"Lost Copter "
"Alarm\" on :ref:`this page <channel-7-and-8-options>`, \"Lost Plane\" in the"
" RCx_OPTION, for example, :ref:`RC5_OPTION <RC5_OPTION>`, or \"Lost Rover\" "
"in the :ref:`Auxiliary Functions <common-auxiliary-functions>`)."
msgstr ""
"若使用支持PWM输出的输出口驱动无源压电器件，可播放各种 :ref:`声音 <common-sounds-"
"pixhawkpx4>`，包括解锁声、模式切换声和飞行器丢失报警声（在 :ref:`此页面 <channel-7-and-8-options>` "
"搜索「Lost Copter Alarm」，在RCx_OPTION中搜索「Lost Plane」，例如 :ref:`RC5_OPTION "
"<RC5_OPTION>`，或在 :ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 中搜索「Lost Rover」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:19 0f86b72261cb4ab295fcc984b5271ce9
#: 27a448c1e825421ca7c2c8bcc39f7b78 9c5147825fe14f9e9ec2639f6d43d2c9
#: b6d61b123ff84d38aff5f1bd53ec1fea cd7e698c5ba04256acb310578f32190f
msgid ""
"in order to use a passive piezo buzzer to play the musical notification "
"tones, the autopilot firmware must have defined that capability to a pin "
"with a timer in its build definition. This is not a capability that the user"
" can add by parameter setup, unlike the use of an active single tone buzzer "
"by designating any GPIO capable pin with :ref:`NTF_BUZZ_PIN<NTF_BUZZ_PIN>`."
msgstr ""
"要使用无源压电蜂鸣器播放音乐通知音调，飞控固件必须在编译定义中将该功能定义到带定时器的引脚上。这不是用户可以通过参数设置添加的功能，与通过 "
":ref:`NTF_BUZZ_PIN<NTF_BUZZ_PIN>` 将任意GPIO引脚指定为有源单音蜂鸣器不同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:21 4ab342622b364d0fb19324560cb94bfe
#: 997b92bc50d54d2c9ddf59741c385bd6 a6807c62b5aa4713a1ec162c4037b89e
#: c479f073f6e346788db0815db5f72d17 efc05e60de5a42f297d88fa2a5772f12
msgid ""
"some autopilots (most of the 1MB flash boards) provide ONLY the ability to "
"use an active buzzer and will provide a limited set of simple beeps instead "
"of musical tones to indicate ARM, DISARM, etc. See the next section for "
"information. However, it is possible to create a custom build of a board's "
"firmware that includes the Tone Alarm functionality. Then motor outputs, can"
" be used to drive a buzzer with the full range of ArduPilot tunes, which can"
" be convenient on boards that only support buzzers that beep. The output "
"used will have to be configured as either ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` =  138 or = "
"139, depending on signal polarity required."
msgstr ""
"部分飞控（大多数1MB闪存板子）仅支持使用有源蜂鸣器，将提供有限的简单蜂鸣音而非音乐音调来指示解锁、上锁等状态。详见下一章节。但可以为板子创建包含音调报警功能的自定义固件编译。这样电机输出就可以用来驱动蜂鸣器，播放ArduPilot的完整音调，这对仅支持简单蜂鸣的板子很方便。所使用的输出需配置为"
" ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` = 138或= 139，具体取决于所需的信号极性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:23 0aed7ce4c3f74af7a4b3b1c6e310b2e9
#: 23a9409fc0aa44d58083c3a439142aaf 72b9493b24b946fc882e31840b67eccb
#: cf4dc59fbd7a4467a45a0df1856733ae f1d1d9d5cb854032bb67906bf0d07cde
msgid ""
"Care must be taken with buzzer selection as the motor/servo outputs can only"
" supply a small current and so it is best to use a buzzer with separate "
"power and amplification such as the `HGLRC Soter FPV drone buzzer "
"<https://www.hglrc.com/products/hglrc-soter-fpv-drone-buzzer>`__.  The "
"buzzer output selected needs to be in a separate PWM group - i.e. it cannot "
"be in the same group as outputs used for other functions such as ESC DSHOT."
msgstr ""
"选择蜂鸣器时需注意，电机/舵机输出只能提供很小的电流，因此最好使用具有独立供电和放大的蜂鸣器，如 `HGLRC Soter FPV无人机蜂鸣器 "
"<https://www.hglrc.com/products/hglrc-soter-fpv-drone-"
"buzzer>`__。所选蜂鸣器输出需要在独立的PWM组中，即不能与ESC DShot等其他功能使用的输出在同一组。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:26 3d5a2953af4d4701992bef22cf6cd36b
#: 4d263b7cb3e34ee3a7248a2c43b61486 6cad52af7d4540c08da9e9e86cbed289
#: d9d60a729b7c46f5b0ef6c5b130863c4 e75808a096f249f4a0cfaed75c440af5
msgid "Using an active buzzer instead of a passive buzzer"
msgstr "使用有源蜂鸣器代替无源蜂鸣器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:28 666191dcc62940b18470a683fa011691
#: 82263a23fd764196be8cf028657af3fe cab85b1ad69b4ffd829513e26540862f
#: e22ff68c65cc4f368e0e24eec16fee3a ebed6f5524114b1b959d1cca32cf3d13
msgid ""
"An active buzzer can be used with boards setup for a passive buzzer in two "
"ways."
msgstr "有源蜂鸣器可通过两种方式用于为无源蜂鸣器设计的板子。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:30 23ba309a7a14439290a470b7bf780f1f
#: 6dfd470eb64e45c0860f2d071a34eac6 be5d37f22de846df89333f15db2b7c93
#: e4f3145789eb4e6f90c448f754ffdeb8 e5103a0a37f34b7e930c1d3ca025e74c
msgid ""
"First, the active buzzer can simply replace the passive piezo on autopilots "
"designed to play Tone Alarms, paying attention to the polarity of the buzzer"
" (unlike passive piezo buzzers, active buzzers need to be connected with the"
" right polarity in order to function  properly. It will play all the sounds,"
" however, potentially at lower volume and without the precise tone "
"frequencies as played with a passive buzzer."
msgstr ""
"第一种，有源蜂鸣器可直接替换设计为播放音调报警的飞控上的无源压电器件，注意蜂鸣器的极性（与无源压电蜂鸣器不同，有源蜂鸣器需按正确极性连接才能正常工作）。它会播放所有声音，但音量可能较低，且音调频率不如无源蜂鸣器精准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:32 08dc6959a51740e7a8a8e80eed27e57e
#: 0bf5bac935404801904729a229b136c4 28a5d873db714d9c99bc068facd50e09
#: 69cfc31a5ea0439fac8906ea4f11e877 8cf37843bd5d453ab529cc13afa91990
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can set the :ref:`NTF_BUZZ_PIN<NTF_BUZZ_PIN>` to a GPIO "
"pin, like those used for :ref:`relay control <common-relay>`, and attach an "
"active buzzer to that pin with its negative lead, and apply power (usually "
"+5V) to the buzzer's positive lead. This is usually how the \"BUZZ\" or "
"\"BUZZ-\" output pin on some autopilots is intended to be used"
msgstr ""
"或者，可将 :ref:`NTF_BUZZ_PIN<NTF_BUZZ_PIN>` 设置为GPIO引脚（如用于 :ref:`继电器控制 <common-"
"relay>` "
"的引脚），将有源蜂鸣器的负极连接到该引脚，正极接电源（通常为+5V）。这通常是某些飞控上「BUZZ」或「BUZZ-」输出引脚的预期使用方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:35 0185f297c0f2419caf0ab990db5c9dea
#: 38735893e7be48edb6f17afac542e7b0 9c488d6186014bc6bfe26dfb40426023
#: e38d490eb3304e90a8934dfcaf6d0090 e75cb43174174884843a1df57a69bbea
msgid ""
":ref:`This function is a GPIO and has limited current capabilities.<gpio-"
"warning>`"
msgstr ":ref:`此功能为 GPIO，电流能力有限。<gpio-warning>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:37 00dda8157d614cc99da6b5c190125bcf
#: 36bbac277487413789c9ae9a6e5e67c5 d9a3e08c06e94834a593065368b38fa2
#: fb3f56e2407046e6804b139b50c51728 fd6b9239f8a34b2a8b2d5229ed87b9ba
msgid ""
"If an active buzzer is used, the :ref:`NTF_BUZZ_ON_LVL<NTF_BUZZ_ON_LVL>` "
"parameter determines the pin level needed to activate it."
msgstr "若使用有源蜂鸣器，:ref:`NTF_BUZZ_ON_LVL<NTF_BUZZ_ON_LVL>` 参数决定激活所需的引脚电平。"

