msgstr "关闭蜂鸣器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:73 30a55866d7f146a5a38e4eac00fdfbc6
#: 79c665e2b1df4c4fa0b1e280d40b184e 89793dcc03204ab3a983338e3ef65bc3
#: dc994dfb816b4828a5cc0f07630c6308 ef3cb4a75c65499283971c3f039f19c4
msgid ""
"Some autopilots (like the HobbyKing PixRacer) have built-in buzzers.  We "
"recommend disabling the these buzzers by setting the following parameter:"
msgstr "部分飞控（如HobbyKing PixRacer）内置蜂鸣器。建议通过设置以下参数来禁用这些内置蜂鸣器："

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:75 13a93f024cbf45e9a63ab9f2050d0cea
